{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is visible, approach, take, check weight, complete task, move or stop. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = CheckObjectWeight    /> <Action ID = MoveToNewLocation    /> <SubTree ID = Task    />\"",
